;; APS acceptance entrypoint generator — copy to acceptance/generator.clj.
;; Turns gherkin-parser JSON IR into thin generated test entry points under
;; acceptance/generated/. Does not embed product step logic.
;;
;; Usage (project convention):
;;   bb acceptance-generate <json-ir> <generated-output-dir>
;; or generate all features as part of `bb acceptance`.
;;
;; Generated entry points must:
;; - embed or load the supplied JSON IR
;; - not parse source .feature files
;; - run every scenario execution via the acceptance runtime + step handlers
;; - be deterministic for a fixed IR
;;
;; Prefer one generated file per feature, e.g.:
;;   acceptance/generated/instructions_content_acceptance.clj

(binding [*out* *err*]
  (println "Replace acceptance/generator.clj.example with acceptance/generator.clj."))
(System/exit 2)
